message: >-
  If you use RectPlacer in your research, please cite the software
  using the metadata below.
title: RectPlacer
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Konno
    given-names: Akihisa
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5191-6105"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/akonno/RectPlacer"
url: "https://akonno.github.io/RectPlacer/"
abstract: >-
  RectPlacer is a browser-based tool for defining and managing
  axis-aligned cuboid regions on STL models, intended for numerical
  analysis preprocessing and research workflows.
keywords:
  - STL
  - cuboid regions
  - numerical analysis
  - preprocessing
  - scientific software
